# Architecture

Phase 1 is this single Next.js website. Phase 2 is a separate mobile companion. During Phase 1, add no mobile app, Expo project, or monorepo.

Reusable business behavior lives in `src/server/services`. Those modules import no React, route files, or UI components. Web routes and server actions call the services. A later mobile client can call the same services over HTTP.

Build only the step requested in `AGENTS.md`. Catalog and provider rules stay in `docs/architecture/data-policy.md`.

```ts
// Bad — business logic tied to the website
import { TripCard } from "@/features/trips/components/trip-card";

// Good — UI-free service a later client can reuse
export async function createTrip(input: CreateTripInput) {}
```
